      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Textual blame shift mapped onto visual leader",
      "description": "The top text 'it didn't happen because of the actions of one man' is mapped onto the visual entity Adolf_Hitler, implying that the historical atrocities were not solely due to Hitler's actions but due to the collective actions of others. This mapping uses the visual prominence of Hitler to represent the 'one man' being blamed, while the text argues that responsibility lies elsewhere.",
