      "description": "The meme promotes a dangerous justification for complicity in genocide and totalitarianism by minimizing the moral responsibility of individuals and promoting the idea that atrocities were the result of 'just doing their jobs'. This is harmful as it normalizes and rationalizes participation in systemic evil, potentially encouraging passive acceptance of injustice or authoritarianism.",
